> user
After a completion has completed in the `completeAsync` function of the `completion-provider.ts` file
do not focus / show the window to make the edit. If the user is typing in another open window while
the edit is being made the edit fails and the response from the LLM is lost. The edit should happen in
the background but also not write directly to disk, the edit api should still be used.

